  "note": "The trial registries: 295 MB of live-captured multiplicity evidence, gitignored, on one disk, and listed in no other manifest. PHILOSOPHY Pillar 3 and D20 rest on a trial count being captured live because it cannot be reconstructed afterwards -- so this file is the derived record of what the databases held when it was written. It is provenance, not a recovery path: unlike data/data_manifest.json there is no blob id, because these were never tracked. If a registry is lost, the counts below are what survives of it.",
