    "why_these": "The pool run_macd_ladder.prior_etf_trials() counts (:729-742). Membership is by programme -- these twelve are the ETF-fixture line; breakout_study, breakdown_study, breakout_universe, breakout_intraday and crypto_pairs are the crypto/breakout line and are a different body of work, not an omission. The enumeration there carries no comment saying so, which is why it is said here.",
